    "UIName": "Grasshopper",
    "Id": "chassisdef_grasshopper_GHR-QS4",
    "Name": "Grasshopper",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Heavy PPC Support. The GHR-QS4 comes with a bevy of Quicsell exclusives. Our infamous EWS combined with Exclusive Stealth X means your enemies won't know what to think! Also comes with enough PPC fire to ensure that anything you point your guns at will get tagged!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>",
